; Last Hero — Act 1, joint 5 (docs/plan/2026-10-15-act1.md): the dark castle.
;
; In by the yard, through a court its guards hold, up to the hall where its lord waits: an earlier
; hero the queen cursed (a STAND-IN look). His death is the turning — the medallion drinks him
; whole, leaves the hero for the queen's hand (she is seen in a vision by the throne), and Act 1
; ends. The fort's pieces drawn with its dark pictures (FelikinRuslan, CC BY 4.0) stand round it.

